{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dao Shu Liu Luo</strong> is a philosophical puzzle game centered on <strong>exploring the panorama of human cognition</strong>.<br>Through the movement and connection of \u201cYin-Yang Points,\u201d players uncover the hidden logical order behind text, structure, and consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage represents an independent layer of cognition.<br>Built upon the <strong>deductive logic of Eastern philosophy</strong>, the game transforms the flowing balance of Yin and Yang, and the Five Elements, into walkable spatial structures.<br>The paths you walk are not merely routes of puzzles \u2014 <strong>they are projections of awareness itself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dao Shu Liu Luo</i>, <strong>to walk is to think, and to connect is to understand.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Cognitive Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Interact between Yin and Yang, between self and shadow, to unveil layered structures of awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Structure as Story</strong> \u2013 No external narrative. Geometry and energy flow themselves become the storytelling medium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Words as Worlds</strong> \u2013 Each Chinese character unfolds into an explorable spatial form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ab <strong>Philosophy Visualized</strong> \u2013 Experience dynamic interpretations of the Five Elements, Eight Trigrams, and Qimen logic in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A <i>Cyber-Oriental</i> aesthetic blended with minimalist sound design to evoke the stillness of an inner consciousness space.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"When Sight First Fractures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4092030/2e8ea8f1db839d66f4732e94a3e